From: maalh <sometimes7799s@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 14:03:37 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 09/20] feat(shell): no user-switching tabs; one distinct link
 per user; mounts for guide, toasts, motion

Removes the Employer/Landlord/Bank/Newcomer tab strip and the Viewing-as menu.
Each person is opened from its own link (/newcomer?as=anders); the person is
kept per browser tab. The brand mark returns to the demo hub at /.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
